<p>Press your advantage when your foes are starting to crumble.</p><p>For every detrimental effect on the target you deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377</acronym> frostdusk damage (with diminishing returns) and reduce its global speed by 25% for one turn per effect (up to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 5, 7, 9</acronym>).</p><p>The diminishing returns on damage bonus works this way:</p><ul><li> 2 effects: <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">268, 360, 432, 493, 547</acronym></li><li> 5 effects: <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">378, 509, 610, 696, 772</acronym></li><li> 10 effects: <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">461, 621, 744, 849, 942</acronym></li><li> 15 effects: <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">510, 686, 823, 939, 1042</acronym></li></ul><p>And so on&hellip;</p><p>Damage increases with your Spellpower.</p><p></p>